     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi Yuchao, <br><br></div>I was attempting to use Canopy (updated from github) to analyze a data set, and while sampling and BIC completed successfully, <a href=\"http://canopy.post\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://canopy.post&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792498509587000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1TkCImXyvy5716OY8YypJA\">canopy.post</a> returned the following error message: <br><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;lucida console&quot;;font-size:10pt;outline:medium none;border-width:medium;border-style:none;border-color:-moz-use-text-color;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:12.5px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in 1:nrow(config.summary) : argument of length 0<br></span><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;lucida console&quot;;font-size:10pt;outline:medium none;border-width:medium;border-style:none;border-color:-moz-use-text-color;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:12.5px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;lucida console&quot;;font-size:10pt;outline:medium none;border-width:medium;border-style:none;border-color:-moz-use-text-color;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:12.5px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Varying the burnin, thin, and post.config.cutoff doesn&#39;t appear to resolve the error. Do you have any advice as to what it might be?<br><br></span></span></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;lucida console&quot;;font-size:10pt;outline:medium none;border-width:medium;border-style:none;border-color:-moz-use-text-color;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:12.5px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Best wishes,<br></span></span></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;lucida console&quot;;font-size:10pt;outline:medium none;border-width:medium;border-style:none;border-color:-moz-use-text-color;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:12.5px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">William<br></span></span></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;lucida console&quot;;font-size:10pt;outline:medium none;border-width:medium;border-style:none;border-color:-moz-use-text-color;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:12.5px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></span></span></span></pre><br></div>\r\n"
